    <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <!--  APP GLYPH MARK                             -->
    <!--                                             -->
    <!--  The product mark reduced to what holds up  -->
    <!--  at 28px, which is the size 取詞翻譯 shows  -->
    <!--  it at. The full icon carries more than     -->
    <!--  that size can. Window and taskbar icons    -->
    <!--  keep the full icon: that is where the app  -->
    <!--  is picked out from among other apps, and   -->
    <!--  it has the room for it there.              -->
    <!--                                             -->
    <!--  From icons/icon-glyph.svg. Its sibling     -->
    <!--  icon-glyph2.svg is the same drawing minus  -->
    <!--  the backing plate and shifted 33, so the   -->
    <!--  frame and the 譯 are declared once here    -->
    <!--  and the plate supplies the offset.         -->
    <!--                                             -->
    <!--  Vector rather than a rasterised ico: this  -->
    <!--  sits inline beside text, so it has to stay -->
    <!--  clean at whatever the caller's DPI turns   -->
    <!--  28 into.                                   -->
    <!--                                             -->
    <!--  Unlike the two marks above, the colours    -->
    <!--  come from the theme. Those are other       -->
    <!--  companies' marks and are fixed; this one   -->
    <!--  is ours, and the dark plate the file ships -->
    <!--  is the heaviest thing in a light-theme row -->
    <!--  built otherwise from thin glyphs and text. -->
    <!--  See AppGlyphInk in the theme files.        -->
    <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->

    <!-- Bare bounds run 0–190 rather than 5–185, because the pen straddles the frame's edge. -->
